			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				580a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἔρημον ἄπολιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1018
				</span></i>
